    "html": "<p>A body of height 40 cm and uniform cross-sectional area floats in water. 10 cm of the height of the body remains above the water line.</p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure></p>\n<p>The density of water is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\rho\"></span>. What is the density of the body?</p>\n<p>[1]</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{1}{4}\\rho\"></span></li><li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{1}{3}\\rho\"></span></li><li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{2}{3}\\rho\"></span></li><li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{3}{4}\\rho\"></span></li></ol>"
